# Antigravity + FlowGrid

- MCP config file: `.agents/mcp_config.json` (not `mcp.json`).
- Server name: `flowgrid` → `bin/flowgrid-mcp.mjs` from the FlowGrid package used at `flowgrid init`.
- Skills live under `.agents/skills/`; rules under `.agents/rules/`.
- Re-sync after config changes: `flowgrid harness sync --agent=gemini_antigravity`.
